<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AX 전략실 오늘의 뉴스 · {{ date }}</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#17171a; --sub:#8a8a90; --bg:#f5f5f3; --card:#ffffff;
    --line:#e9e9e6; --black:#0b0b0c; --hair:#26262a;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);
       font-family:'Apple SD Gothic Neo','Pretendard','Malgun Gothic',system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
       line-height:1.65;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;letter-spacing:-.005em;}
  a{color:inherit;}

  /* ── 헤더(블랙) ── */
  header{background:var(--black);color:#fff;padding:20px 24px 16px;}
  header .wrap{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;}
  header .brand{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;
                letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.15;}
  header .title{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;
                letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#cfcfd3;}
  nav.dates{background:var(--black);padding:0 24px 14px;}
  nav.dates .wrap{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:6px;
                  overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:2px;
                  scrollbar-width:none;-ms-overflow-style:none;
                  -webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,#000 calc(100% - 44px),transparent 100%);
                  mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,#000 calc(100% - 44px),transparent 100%);}
  /* 스크롤바 숨김 + 오른쪽 가장자리 페이드 — 더 스크롤할 수 있음을 은은히 암시 */
  nav.dates .wrap::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}
  nav.dates a{flex:none;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;
              text-decoration:none;color:#9c9ca3;border:1px solid var(--hair);
              transition:.15s;}
  nav.dates a:hover{color:#fff;}
  nav.dates a.on{background:#fff;color:var(--black);font-weight:600;border-color:#fff;}
  nav.dates a.home{color:#cececf;border-color:transparent;padding-left:0;}

  /* ── 레이아웃: 좌측 LNB + 본문 ── */
  .layout{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 24px 6px;
          display:grid;grid-template-columns:200px 1fr;gap:32px;
          align-items:start;}
  main{min-width:0;}
  aside.lnb{position:sticky;top:18px;}
  aside.lnb h3{font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;
               color:#9c9ca3;margin:0 0 10px;padding:0 12px;font-weight:700;}
  aside.lnb ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;}
  aside.lnb a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
              gap:8px;padding:9px 12px;text-decoration:none;color:#5b5b62;
              font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;border-left:2px solid transparent;
              border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;transition:.15s;}
  aside.lnb a:hover{background:#ececea;color:var(--ink);
                    border-left-color:var(--sub);}
  aside.lnb .count{color:#a0a0a4;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;}
  @media (max-width:880px){
    .layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:18px 18px 0;gap:0;}
    aside.lnb{display:none;}
  }
  details.cat{margin-bottom:8px;}
  details.cat>summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;
       gap:11px;padding:15px 2px 13px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);
       font-size:16.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;user-select:none;}
  details.cat>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  details.cat>summary .count{color:var(--sub);font-weight:500;font-size:12.5px;
       border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);
       padding:1px 8px;border-radius:99px;}
  details.cat>summary .chev{margin-left:auto;color:var(--sub);font-size:12px;
       transition:transform .2s ease;}
  details.cat:not([open])>summary .chev{transform:rotate(-90deg);}
  details.cat:not([open])>summary{border-bottom-color:var(--line);}

  .grid{display:grid;gap:16px;padding:20px 0 22px;
        grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(284px,1fr));}
  .card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;
        overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column;
        transition:transform .16s ease,box-shadow .16s ease;}
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(11,11,12,.11);}
  .thumb{display:block;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:#e7e7e3;overflow:hidden;position:relative;}
  .thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;position:relative;z-index:2;}
  /* 출처명 텍스트 폴백 — 항상 가운데. 위에 이미지가 깔리면 가려진다 */
  .thumb .thumb-src{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;display:flex;
       align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:0 16px;
       font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#6b6b72;letter-spacing:-.01em;line-height:1.4;}
  /* 썸네일이 없으면 출처 사이트 로고를 가운데 정렬한 기본 이미지로 표시 */
  .thumb.is-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
       background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3f3f1,#e7e7e3);}
  .thumb.is-logo img.logo{width:auto;height:auto;max-width:54px;max-height:54px;
       object-fit:contain;border-radius:10px;
       box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(11,11,12,.12);background:#fff;padding:7px;}
  /* 로고가 실제로 떠야 출처명 텍스트를 숨긴다(로고 실패 시 텍스트 노출 유지) */
  .thumb.has-logo .thumb-src{display:none;}
  .body{padding:15px 16px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;flex:1;}
  .title{font-weight:700;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.46;letter-spacing:-.015em;
         text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink);
         display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;}
  .summary{margin:0;font-size:12.8px;color:#5f5f66;line-height:1.6;flex:1;
           display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;}
  .meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11px;color:var(--sub);
        border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:10px;margin-top:2px;}
  .src{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);}
  .read{margin-left:auto;text-decoration:none;color:var(--sub);transition:.15s;}
  .card:hover .read{color:var(--ink);}

  /* ── 회차 섹션 ── */
  .slot{scroll-margin-top:18px;margin-bottom:36px;}
  .slot-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:0 0 14px;
             font-size:19px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.025em;color:var(--ink);
             padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink);}
  .slot-count{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sub);
              border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--card);
              padding:2px 9px;border-radius:99px;}

  /* ── 핵심 인사이트 ── */
  .insight{max-width:1140px;margin:0 auto;padding:26px 24px 0;}
  .insight-card{background:#161618;color:#fafafa;border-radius:14px;
                padding:24px 26px 26px;border:1px solid #26262a;margin:0 0 18px;}
  .insight-title{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;
                 letter-spacing:-.025em;color:#fafafa;}
  .insight-list{margin:0;padding:0 0 0 22px;color:#f0f0f3;}
  .insight-list li{margin:0 0 11px;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;
                   letter-spacing:-.005em;}
  .insight-list li:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
  .insight-list li::marker{color:#9c9ca3;}

  /* ── 의견 보내기 ── */
  .feedback{max-width:1140px;margin:10px auto 0;padding:20px 24px 0;}
  .fb-card{background:var(--black);color:#fff;border-radius:14px;
           padding:30px 28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;}
  .fb-card h2{margin:0 0 7px;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;}
  .fb-card p{margin:0 0 18px;color:#9c9ca3;font-size:13px;max-width:560px;}
  .fb-btn{display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:var(--black);text-decoration:none;
          padding:11px 26px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:13px;
          transition:.15s;}
  .fb-btn:hover{background:#d8d8d8;}
  footer{max-width:1140px;margin:30px auto;padding:20px 24px;color:var(--sub);
         font-size:11.5px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:.01em;}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="brand">AX 전략실</h1>
    <h2 class="title">오늘의 뉴스 - {{ date.replace('-', '.') }}</h2>
  </div>
</header>
<nav class="dates">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="home" href="index.html">← 전체 아카이브</a>
    {% for d in all_dates %}
      <a href="{{ d }}.html" class="{{ 'on' if d == date else '' }}">{{ d }}</a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</nav>

<div class="layout">
  <aside class="lnb">
    <h3>회차</h3>
    <ul>
      {% for s in slots %}
      <li><a href="#slot-{{ s.key }}">
        <span>{{ s.label }}</span>
        <span class="count">{{ s.count }}</span>
      </a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </aside>
  <main>
    {% for s in slots %}
    <section class="slot" id="slot-{{ s.key }}">
      <h2 class="slot-head">
        <span>{{ s.label }}</span>
        <span class="slot-count">{{ s.count }}건</span>
      </h2>

      {% if s.insight %}
      <div class="insight-card">
        <h3 class="insight-title">💡 이 회차의 핵심 인사이트</h3>
        <ul class="insight-list">
          {% for line in s.insight.splitlines() %}{% if line.strip() %}
          <li>{{ line.strip() }}</li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      {% for g in s.groups %}
      <details class="cat" id="cat-{{ s.key }}-{{ g.key }}" open>
        <summary>
          <span>{{ g.label }}</span>
          <span class="count">{{ g.articles|length }}</span>
          <span class="chev">▾</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="grid">
          {% for a in g.articles %}
          <article class="card">
            {% set logo = a.url | favicon %}
            <a class="thumb{% if not a.thumbnail %} is-logo{% endif %}" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              {# 최종 폴백: 썸네일도 로고도 못 띄우면 출처명 텍스트가 보인다 #}
              <span class="thumb-src">{{ a.source }}</span>
              {% if a.thumbnail %}<img src="{{ a.thumbnail }}" loading="lazy" alt=""
                   onerror="var p=this.parentElement;{% if logo %}this.onerror=function(){this.remove();p.classList.remove('has-logo');};this.className='logo';p.classList.add('is-logo','has-logo');this.src='{{ logo }}';{% else %}this.remove();{% endif %}">
              {% elif logo %}<img class="logo" src="{{ logo }}" loading="lazy" alt=""
                   onload="this.parentElement.classList.add('has-logo')"
                   onerror="this.remove()">{% endif %}
            </a>
            <div class="body">
              <a class="title" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ a.title }}</a>
              <p class="summary">{{ a.summary or a.raw_excerpt }}</p>
              <div class="meta">
                <span class="src">{{ a.source }}</span>
                <a class="read" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">원문 →</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </details>
      {% else %}
      <p style="color:var(--sub);">이 회차에는 수집된 기사가 없습니다.</p>
      {% endfor %}
    </section>
    {% else %}
    <p style="color:var(--sub);">이 날짜에는 수집된 기사가 없습니다.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </main>
</div>

<section class="feedback">
  <div class="fb-card">
    <h2>AX 전략실 뉴스봇 개선사항을 남겨주세요!</h2>
    {% if feedback_ready %}
    <p>주제·소스·요약 형식 등 개선 아이디어를 자유롭게 남겨 주세요.
       팀의 의견이 다음 업데이트에 반영됩니다.</p>
    <a class="fb-btn" href="{{ feedback_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">의견 보내기</a>
    {% else %}
    <p>관리자가 <code>config.yaml</code> 의 <code>feedback_form_url</code> 에 Google Form
       주소를 입력하면 여기에 의견 보내기 버튼이 표시됩니다.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<footer>AX 전략실 · 평일 하루 3회(아침·점심·저녁) 자동 발행 · 데이터 출처는 각 기사 원문 매체에 있습니다</footer>
<script>
  // LNB 링크 클릭 시 접혀 있는 카테고리도 자동 펼친 뒤 스크롤
  document.querySelectorAll('aside.lnb a[href^="#"]').forEach(function(a){
    a.addEventListener('click', function(){
      var t = document.getElementById(a.getAttribute('href').slice(1));
      if (t && t.tagName === 'DETAILS') t.open = true;
    });
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
